---
<section class="differentials">
  <div class="differentials-container">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon">
          <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
          <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="card-title">Atendimento Personalizado</h3>
      <p class="card-text">Análise aprofundada de cada caso diretamente por advogados especialistas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="card-title">Suporte Técnico Integrado</h3>
      <p class="card-text">Contamos com Técnico em Segurança do Trabalho próprio para perícias trabalhistas e laudos técnicos precisos.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon">
          <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
          <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
          <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
          <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
          <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="card-title">Transparência Total</h3>
      <p class="card-text">Acompanhamento claro e descomplicado do andamento de cada processo.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0d2137;
    --petrol: #1a3a5c;
    --gold: #b8943e;
    --gray-light: #f4f5f7;
    --gray-medium: #6b7280;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --graphite: #374151;
  }

  .differentials {
    background-color: var(--navy);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .differentials-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .card {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .card-title {
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .card-text {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Tablet and Desktop */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .differentials-container {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .differentials {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .differentials-container {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
